    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33280" root="فدن" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَدَّادُونَ</span></b>  is said to signify <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْحَابُ الفَدَادِينَ</span>
[<i>The possessors of ploughing oxen</i>]; like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَّالُونَ</span>
signifies “ possessors of camels: ” but it has been
otherwise expl. in [its proper place, as pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَدَّادٌ</span>,
in] art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فد</span>. (K.)

